    ^#00A9FF;면역^reset;: ^green;겁먹음, 화상, 녹아내림
    ^#00A9FF;종족 특성^reset;: -
^white;낙하 피해^reset;: ^green;-25%^reset;, ^white;넉백 저항^reset;: ^green;+5%^reset;, ^white;숨 소모 속도^reset;: ^green;-12.5%^reset;, ^white;최대 숨^reset;: ^green;+50.0^reset;, ^white;배고픔 속도^reset;: ^green;-15%^reset;

